v3.0.0 - back to working on the game

Bug Fixes:
+ Days logged in now increments even if you never leave the game.
+ Clover Upgrader is now anchored and usable.
+ Luck Machine (on base) no longer has a collision.
+ You can now craft one potion (previously could not craft less than 2 potions).

Changes:
+ People with enough playtime to justify days logged in have been adjusted.
+ New Build Mode, which includes Box Select, Axis Binding, and tons of new filters
+ Added a Mailbox, which will tell you about updates (no longer need to read this)
+ Rewrote gifting logic, also added support for Mail, which will be used during special events.

+ Added 8 new thumbnails to the game.

Balance Changes:
+ Decreased Life 8 Rebirth price: 1Ud -> 50N 
+ Added 2 new tiles of space for Life 8.

Nerd Info:
+ Added the ability for testers to modify items on the fly.
+ Added the ability for testers to simulate rolls.
+ Added the ability for testers to simulate merchant rolls.

+ Started cleaning up the codebase. Removing old code, duplicate code, 

